# Backend API URL. REQUIRED when frontend runs on Loveable (cloud) - backend must be reachable.
# - Loveable cloud: deploy backend (Render/Railway) then set: https://your-app.onrender.com
# - Loveable + local backend: use ngrok (ngrok http 8000) and set the ngrok URL here
# - Local/same-network: leave unset (uses hostname:8000)
# VITE_API_URL=
